,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596944037,"data":"best val loss 4.0183 (bpb 1.9162). sample:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596947364,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596950392,"data":"That I’ll leave thee to do my mistress’\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596961959,"data":"Which, as I did do I have,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596965289,"data":"But that I will believe ’tis so much.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596968545,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596971632,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596974758,"data":"Come to you, and my lord, good Moth, I know.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596977987,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59698107,"data":"KING.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596984134,"data":"Who’s to th’ world.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596987334,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596990431,"data":"SUFFOLK.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.596995185,"data":"My lords, then, and my liege.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597002576,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597034861,"data":"QUEEN MARGARET.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597038815,"data":"Why, when’s all these, what news would you stay?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597043117,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597046514,"data":"KING RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597050543,"data":"What, how?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59705439,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597061582,"data":"SPEIAM.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597065147,"data":"I pray you, my lords, I’ll have a good man.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597068593,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597071798,"data":"KING HENRY.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597075218,"data":"Not to my life?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.5970786,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597081807,"data":"CASSIUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597085075,"data":"The gods!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597088394,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597091692,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597095025,"data":"Here, sir, he is not done; you will love thee.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597098457,"data":"Where is the news?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597101808,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597105005,"data":"LUCIUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59710843,"data":"I’ll tell you, if you love you in your love?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597118254,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597133497,"data":"YORK.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597137703,"data":"O, with you.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597141546,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597144987,"data":"[_Exeunt._]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597149017,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597152867,"data":"SCENE III. A street. Before Save.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597156335,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597159603,"data":"SCENE III. A Room in the Duke’s house.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597163114,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597166397,"data":"Enter Hastings, Servant.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597169829,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597173214,"data":"Enter Lord Timon, York, Heaven and Would we, Richmond, Duke and Milius,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597176709,"data":"Amen.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597180003,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597183302,"data":"ANTONY.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597186597,"data":"[_Reads_.] O, sweet Nature, and Launcelet,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597189991,"data":"And in the King Henry’s palace.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597193407,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597196629,"data":"Enter Warwick and others with the Gastian.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597200052,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597203252,"data":"QUEEN MARGARET.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597206655,"data":"He that which’s the King my lord, and the night\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597216031,"data":"And give our friends.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597231906,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59723619,"data":"BRUTUS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597239999,"data":"My lord, my lord of Cymbelia,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597244332,"data":"But here’s officer.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597248545,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597252055,"data":"CATEST.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597255402,"data":"The King hath been much.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597258757,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597261939,"data":"KING.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597268603,"data":"Well, if your daughter be dead.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597272043,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597275373,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59727865,"data":"I should in that I\n"}
