,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597599779,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597602902,"data":"And to the sceptre of all my forehead\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597610702,"data":"Upon a little messenger.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597613393,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597616435,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597630284,"data":"O blessed heavens,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597634252,"data":"If I have power to do it so much!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597637981,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597641274,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597645181,"data":"Where’s the matter?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597649018,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597652111,"data":"CERIMON.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597655265,"data":"I’ll do’t, sir, let’s see ’t not.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597658564,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597661637,"data":"MARINA.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597664707,"data":"We’ll bear it as your highness.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597667909,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597670902,"data":"IMONIDES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597674019,"data":"I thank your lordship.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597677269,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597680266,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597683461,"data":"[_Aside._] Let me be sure, sir, if you please\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597686674,"data":"To see one or any of them,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597689882,"data":"And she will never come to me.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597693051,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597696086,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597699176,"data":"It is the next, sir, with a most good grace\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597702485,"data":"That ever I give the king’s gift to me\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597711104,"data":"Than she shall have spoke.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597714297,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597741371,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597751515,"data":"Well, well,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597756189,"data":"You see the world or man of my life.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597760052,"data":"The lady, as well as you have said!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597763246,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597766327,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597769479,"data":"This is the more my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59777266,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597775655,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59777877,"data":"I have, sir.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597781904,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597784997,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597788108,"data":"The reason is, so: you are bound.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597791272,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597794284,"data":" Enter Dolabella, attended.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597797471,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597800531,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597803674,"data":"I know it more. I have done in this,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597806866,"data":"A woman that I may give us thanks.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597810078,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59781323,"data":" Enter Gratiano and Marina.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597822197,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597824899,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597839353,"data":"What’s the matter?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597843425,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597846956,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597850296,"data":"That thou hast lost thyself, a son of father,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597854443,"data":"Of thy great self-serving?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597857856,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597860971,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597864001,"data":"Here, sir,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597867179,"data":"Who hast thou but been, that thou dost make\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597870431,"data":"A daughter to thyself and I will make a daughter.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597873678,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597876774,"data":"PERICLES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597879912,"data":"Too that, thou art believ’d; and have a soul\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597883227,"data":"To be a Roman, who may be so long,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597886442,"data":"If thou wouldst hear the deed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.597889588,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59789259,"data":"\n"}
