,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598213776,"data":"best val loss 3.5630 (bpb 1.6990). sample:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598217217,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598225994,"data":"Trib, from such a king’s court\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598229612,"data":"Shall to rehearse the King, and his daughter,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59825607,"data":"Unto whose state he hath committed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598260066,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598263732,"data":"KING JOHN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598267428,"data":"You do rejoice a daughter, that she\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598271289,"data":"Should be the King’s king, and I, is my daughter,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598274781,"data":"And you will send my servant to my daughter’s daughter.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598278055,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598281045,"data":"KING JOHN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598284145,"data":"She’s yours that, she being accus’d in her,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598287449,"data":"She is not so far.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598290613,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598293672,"data":"DIANA.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598296789,"data":"My gracious lord,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598299924,"data":"And he did know you, if you have no power,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598303137,"data":"You will not hold your offer.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598306311,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598309316,"data":"KING PHILIP.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598312492,"data":"By the King, he is encompierced,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.5983157,"data":"And therefore she is to come from heaven.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598318888,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598322042,"data":" [_Exeunt._]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598325183,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598333839,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598337217,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598352064,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59835607,"data":"ACT IV\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598359692,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598363434,"data":"SCENE I. France. A street.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598367181,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598370325,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598373369,"data":"Enter King John Albanor of York, Beaufort, Lancaster, Marquess,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598376629,"data":"and Eleans, Black Prince of Mon Peter, and others.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598379787,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598382793,"data":"KING JOHN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598385938,"data":"O God, pardon me that my son is dead.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598389065,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59839206,"data":"KING JOHN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598398385,"data":"How now, brother! What would this be done?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59840166,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598404646,"data":"KING PHUIS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598407803,"data":"In faith of England, Lord Percy, this deadly slain.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598415876,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598418985,"data":"KING PHILIP.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598423888,"data":"My lord, not an angry king!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598430664,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598433219,"data":"KING JOHN.\n"}
