,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59879722,"data":"And he, a woman that hath made me happy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598800425,"data":"O, now, see I will not bind me from my life;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598803618,"data":"For I am not a villain, and I know no.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598806921,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59881164,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598818801,"data":"Then, then, now I do confess, I do love thee.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598833673,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598837385,"data":"QUEEN MARGARET.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598841194,"data":"Why, canst thou be thy Protector for that?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59884499,"data":"No, no. I am no more than thou canst.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598849151,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598855796,"data":"ANNE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598858928,"data":"Marry, I dare love thee.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598862111,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598865134,"data":"ANNE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598868213,"data":"But stay, gentle sister, as you love me?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598871366,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59887439,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598877478,"data":"Yes, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598880555,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598883672,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598886784,"data":"Ay, my lord.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598889855,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598892965,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59889603,"data":"Then, so much, as I should, I’ll be loyal.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598899358,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598902368,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598907295,"data":"Marry, and I think thou dost. That I will take thy soul.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598910477,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598917011,"data":"ANNE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598931323,"data":"Why, not I; and thou art a woman, boy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598935342,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598938968,"data":"ANNE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598942788,"data":"I would I were not honest, so did I.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598946624,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598949671,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598952805,"data":"But look not upon the cassel that I am the one.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598956006,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598959029,"data":"ANNE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598962081,"data":"I fear it better, madam.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598965199,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598968278,"data":"ANNE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598971365,"data":"I cannot see that oath for that I think,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598974681,"data":"If that I had noted my brother,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.5989779,"data":"A mother had a mother of old child.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.59898113,"data":"But so do I. But now, gentle cousin,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598984318,"data":"I would not have her, nor did she weep.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598987509,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598990555,"data":"ANNE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598993643,"data":"Ay me, and I had her now, but I am sure.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598996832,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.598999945,"data":"RICHARD.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.599008955,"data":"I were not my uncle, hers, nor she is.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3551.599012051,"data":"\n"}
